 1459 2ABA ~            ; DE:HL = a + b. With |a| >= |b| -- swapped if not -- the result has a's sign, and b's
 1460 2ABA ~            ; significand, shifted down to a's exponent, is added to a's or taken from it. A subnormal is
 1461 2ABA ~            ; taken as exponent 1 without the leading one, and comes the same way; a NaN, an infinity and a
 1462 2ABA ~            ; zero b are dealt with before.
 1463 2ABA ~            ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
