 2167 2ABA ~                ELSE
 2168 2ABA ~                ; Two normal numbers, as __x80_fmul takes them: the low words to fpa and fpb, the high words
 2169 2ABA ~                ; read where they come, a's leading one put in, the divisor's top byte in D and the exponent
 2170 2ABA ~                ; made in registers. Anything else goes the general way, everything stored as
 2171 2ABA ~                ; __x80_fp_load2 would have.
